# ex08 — relationship hops fixture (mirrors demos/1-selection/08-relationship-hops.bqn)
# mentor is nullable (-1 dangling: rows 1, 4); faction is total — rows 0..1 double as
# faction entities in the same id space. hasMentor is derived by the emitter from the sentinel.
n 6
rel mentor 2 -1 4 2 -1 1
rel faction 0 0 0 1 0 1
col nord bool 1 1 1 1 0 1
col twoHanded num 90 20 85 70 81 30
col student bool 1 1 1 1 0 1
col dead bool 0 0 1 0 1 0
col mentored bool 1 0 1 1 0 1
col soldier bool 0 0 1 1 1 1
col atWar bool 1 0 0 0 0 0
col gold num 0 0 0 0 0 0
col morale num 100 100 100 100 100 100
